DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T160000
UID:260816QGo3USmcUUe5YvSuKgyRjg
DESCRIPTION:August Theme: Dissections Day: Saturday Time: 3 - 4 p.m. Recom
 mended Ages: STEM Saturday is designed for ages 5 and up and their caregiv
 ers. Cost: Free for Members / Free with Museum Admission August Dissection
  Activities might include: Worms\, eggs\, and fake frogs Cow eyes and Pin 
 holes Onions and other veggies \\(cells and building blocks\\) Flower diss
 ections and Fibonacci Robot arms Every week\, STEM Saturday sparks curiosi
 ty and creativity as kids and caregivers explore the wonders of science\, 
 technology\, engineering\, and math together. Hands-on and full of fun\, t
 hese activities turn learning into an adventure.
LOCATION:Wonderlab
URL:https://wonderlab.org/event/stem-saturday-8/2026-08-22/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:IU Welcome Weekend 2026: Saturday Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T191600
UID:260807EY_jmS3RJUS_y-dPnrrT5w
DESCRIPTION:Keep the Welcome Week celebrations going at Oliver Winery duri
 ng IU Welcome Weekend 2026! Whether you're a new Hoosier\, a proud alum\, 
 or a family in town for move-in weekend\, join us for an IU-inspired celeb
 ration filled with festive spirit\, great wine\, and Welcome Week fun. ❤
 ️ What to Expect: Win Big: Enter for a chance to win 2 tickets to the IU
  vs. Purdue game on November 28! Live DJ: Enjoy live music from 4–7 PM a
 s you celebrate the start of a new school year. $20 IU-Themed Patio Flight
 s: Sip through a special selection of wines and take home a complimentary 
 IU souvenir wine glass\, while supplies last. 25% Off Charcuterie Boards: 
 Show your valid CrimsonCard or IU Student ID to enjoy 25% off charcuterie 
 boards. 15% Off: Save on Back-to-School Cream & Crimson Wine Gift Boxes an
 d IU merchandise. IU-Inspired Pairings: Check out featured tasting room si
 gnage with wine pairing suggestions for local IU and downtown restaurants.
  Lawn Games: Challenge your friends and enjoy lawn games on the patio thro
 ughout the weekend. Mini IU Pep Rally: Join us for a special mini pep rall
 y featuring the IU Cheerleaders! Time TBD — check back soon for updates.
  Grab your friends\, show your IU pride\, and make Oliver Winery part of y
 our Welcome Week tradition. Sip\, celebrate\, and get ready for another gr
 eat year in Bloomington! ❤️ Check back soon for additional details and
  updates!
LOCATION:Oliver Winery
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2087332118824109/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Toddler Sports Classes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T120000
UID:2603244uhGjP3M1EqzUfL7s6wTfQ
DESCRIPTION:Playpen Sports Academy is a wonderful way to introduce your ch
 ild to the world of sport and physical activity in a non-intimidating envi
 ronment with a small group of other toddlers and parents. The Playpen Spor
 ts Academy Curriculum is focused on a number of different goals including 
 teaching children how to move and use their bodies\, sharing with other ch
 ildren\, interact in social settings\, follow directions\, and most import
 antly how to have fun in a physically active environment. At Playpen Sport
 s Academy\, we are focused as much on the individual development of your c
 hild as we are on sport specific skills that we teach. Because while we ex
 pect some of your children to go on to be great athletes\, we expect all o
 f your children to go on to be great people!
URL:https://www.playpensports.com/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
