SUMMARY:John Waldron Arts Centere
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260826T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260826T140000
UID:2608173XcNhgUl0UKYMTbsWwLJoQ
DESCRIPTION:date/time: 8/16-8/26 @ 2pm and 7pm Love is never simple. At le
 ast it's funny. Starring Bloomington's favorite acting duo - Valerie C. Ki
 lmer & Bobby Ayala Perez! In this clever \\(and extremely funny\\) play ab
 out relationships\, five couples explore the delights and disappointments 
 of their sex lives. Whether they are the first two people on Earth or the 
 last two\, modern partners with shifting needs\, exes on the eve of a life
 -altering event\, or twelfth-century pen pals\, following those most natur
 al desires uncovers truths about their humanity. Chiara Atik's Five Times 
 in One Night is a hilarious examination of intimacy through the ages. "A s
 harp\, witty meditation on relationships through time." - Stage Buddy "One
  of the most thoroughly entertaining\, original\, and enjoyable shows I've
  seen." -This Week in New York Age Recommendation: 18\\+
LOCATION:ids@iu.edu
URL:https://guides.idsnews.com/happenings/event/5-times-in-one-night-a28b
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
