SUMMARY:Kidical Mass: A Back to School Family Bike Ride & Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260827T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260827T190000
UID:260805sLt19kQ4J0aSDFD3sQFG2A
DESCRIPTION:Kidical Mass: A Back to School Family Bike Ride & Celebration 
 is a free fun\, family friendly celebration of the new school year and bik
 es by the City of Bloomington and IU Health. Bring your bikes and enjoy a 
 short\, slow paced ride designed for kids and their families\, followed by
  games\, bike-blended smoothies\, popsicles\, a helmet decoration station\
 , free bike lights\, quick bike repairs\, and more.\n\n**Additional inform
 ation:**\n\nChildren under 11 years old must be accompanied by an adult\n\
 nWe ask that all independent riders have 1-2 years of riding experience\n\
 nRiders must not ride ahead of lead bike\n\nRides must follow instructions
  from ride leader and marshals to stay safe\n\nYou may choose to ride 1mi 
 or 2.5mi with the group. We will all leave together at 5:30pm and return t
 o the starting location after 1mi and again after 2.5 mi (total).\n\nA “
 Bike Rodeo” course will be set up in the parking lot. This is an activit
 y geared towards younger kids\, balance bikers\, or those learning to ride
 .\n\nPre-registration is not required\, but you are welcome to **sign-up*
 * to request to borrow a bike or for reminders and updates.
LOCATION:Bryan Park
URL:https://bloomington.in.gov/transportation/ss4a/safety-week
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
