  Location: WonderLab Cost: Free for Members / Free with Museum Admission C
 uriosity Lab is an after-school\, free play program for kids ages 6-10 yea
 rs. Children are invited to explore\, experiment\, and engage in hands-on 
 sensory activities at their own pace. No instructions\, no pressure-just c
 uriosity-driven play. Held in WonderLab \\(or sometimes outdoors weather p
 ermitting\\)\, the space is set up for exploration with a variety of rotat
 ing materials and stations. There will be one main activity/installment/ma
 nipulative for the month that will be brought out every Thursday. This wil
 l rotate with the month and the month's theme.
