 ter!\n\nBEACH is a dance/theatre production that will transport you to whe
 re tides swell\, herons wade\, gulls prey\, and people play. Water meets e
 arth. What transpires and what is abandoned at the precipice of worldly co
 nnectivity?\n\nThis event is not happening at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater 
 but at Constellation Playhouse located at 107 W 9th St Bloomington\, IN 47
 404.
