BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tiles & Tastings with Mahj in Bloom
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260913T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260913T164600
UID:260807rQFO6m3B9kyQmSeV96PWHw
DESCRIPTION:Mahjong\, wine\, and a little friendly competition? Yes\, plea
 se! Join us at Oliver Winery for Tiles & Tastings\, a lively afternoon of 
 American Mahjong hosted by Mahj in Bloom. Grab a glass of wine\, find your
  table\, and get ready for an afternoon of tiles\, laughs\, and just enoug
 h competitive energy to keep things interesting. We’ll play two rounds o
 f open play with a short break in between to refresh your drink\, switch t
 ables\, and meet fellow Mahjong lovers. Your ticket includes: • Two roun
 ds of open play • A short break to refresh your drink and switch tables 
 • One complimentary glass of Oliver wine • Non-alcoholic beverage opti
 ons will also be available Please note: This is not a lesson. Beginners ar
 e welcome\, but all players should be familiar with the rules and order of
  play for National Mah Jongg League American Mahjong and be prepared to pl
 ay independently. Guests should bring their own 2026 NMJL card. Bring your
  game face\, grab a glass\, and let’s Mahj!
LOCATION:Oliver Winery
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/894880363169564/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
