SUMMARY:Always A Little Bit Tipsy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T213000
UID:260708ZQwAzwneEk27fA0MRkrlkw
DESCRIPTION:The world premiere of *Always a Little Bit Tipsy* will take pl
 ace in Bloomington\, Indiana this September! Based on the topsy-turvy lif
 e of world-champion ballroom dancer and drag artist Tom Slater (a.k.a. Tip
 sy Teasedale) the all-new original musical\, *Always a Little Bit Tipsy\,*
  explores survival\, masculinity\, and the healing power of drag. This is 
 a story about the violence of small shames\, the masks we build to survive
 \, and the radical act of becoming whole. Produced by After the Storm Prod
 uctions and YOUnique Studio.
LOCATION:Waldron Art Center
URL:http://afterthestormproductions.com/tipsy
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
