UID:260803fEFjrwT5C0K6-HEzjPCY9g
DESCRIPTION:***Coyote vs Acme* (2026)**\n\nAfter Acme products fail him o
 ne too many times in his dogged pursuit of the Roadrunner\, Wile E. Coyote
  decides to hire a billboard lawyer (Will Forte) to sue the Acme Corporati
 on. A growing friendship between Coyote and Kevin motivates their determin
 ation to win the court case\, as it pits them against Buddy Crane\, the in
 timidating boss of Kevin’s former law firm\, who now represents Acme.\n\
 nBased on “Coyote v. Acme” by Ian Frazier\n\nStarring: Will Forte\, La
 na Condor\, Tone Bell\, John Cena\n\nDirected by Dave Green\n\nScreenplay 
 by Samy Burch\n\nRated: PG\n\nLength: 1hr 50mins\n\nFormat: DCP
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/coyote-vs-acme-2026-september-26-202
 6/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
