BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tomorrow's Sentry
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T190000
UID:2608051CPBCRo4-U22LC0Oo7j6uw
DESCRIPTION:***Tomorrow’s Sentry:* One forgotten trunk. One extraordina
 ry life. One community’s untold story.**\n\nWhen 102-year-old Bloomingto
 n resident Dot Weaver dies\, she left behind fragments of a hidden history
  waiting to be discovered. Audiences are taken on an unforgettable journey
  though Monroe County’s controversial history — from the post Civil Wa
 r era to today. Filled with celebrations\, overdue realizations\, and less
 ons for future generations\, *Tomorrow’s Sentry* reminds us that today
 ’s youth will become tomorrow’s guardians of history.
LOCATION:John Waldron Arts Center Auditorium
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/tomorrow-s-sentry-october-2-2026/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
