BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tomorrow's Sentry
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261003T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261003T150000
UID:260805d3mgKag6OkC_wU3OwnUH7Q
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow’s Sentry: One forgotten trunk. One extraordinary li
 fe. One community’s untold story.\n\nWhen 102-year-old Bloomington resid
 ent Dot Weaver dies\, she leaves behind fragments of a hidden history wait
 ing to be discovered. Audiences are taken on an unforgettable journey thou
 gh Monroe County’s controversial history — from the post Civil War era
  to today. Filled with celebrations\, overdue realizations\, and lessons f
 or future generations\, Tomorrow’s Sentry reminds us that today’s yout
 h will become tomorrow’s guardians of history.
LOCATION:John Waldron Arts Center Auditorium
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/tomorrow-s-sentry-october-3-2026-2
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
