BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hotel California – The Original Eagles Tribute
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261108T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261108T213000
UID:260504dqJMfLCZmUmgYgGnzZjBvw
DESCRIPTION:For over three decades now **HOTEL CALIFORNIA** have been re
 creating the legendary sound of **The Eagles**\, and thrilling audiences 
 all over the world. From the quintessential Eagles anthem “**Hotel Calif
 ornia**” thru “**Take It Easy**”\, “**Lyin’ Eyes**”\, “**Tak
 e It to the Limit**”\, “**Peaceful Easy Feeling**”\, “**One of The
 se Nights**”\, “**Dirty Laundry**”\, “**Already Gone**”\, “**T
 he Long Run**”\, “**Life In the Fast Lane**” and “**Desperado**”
 \, they have evolved into a masterful celebration of **The Eagles**’ mu
 sic.\n\nThe band set the bar in 1986\, and they’ve remained the industry
  leading substitute for **The Eagles** ever since. Playing to huge outdoo
 r and arena audiences\, sharing bills with some of rock’s legends\, and 
 going places no tribute band has gone before. A long run by any measure\, 
 but it begs the question – what makes **HOTEL CALIFORNIA** so special?
 \n\nSimply put\, incredible lead vocal similarity\, intensely accurate ins
 trumental work\, soaring harmonies\, and top-flight live performances\, ju
 st for starters. These are the band’s hallmarks\, and the foundation on 
 which their reputation has been built. With over a century of collective p
 rofessional experience in the band today\, they’re still going stronger 
 than ever!\n\nIf you love **The Eagles**\, then welcome to the **HOTEL CA
 LIFORNIA** – you’ve just found the next-best thing.
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/hotel-california-the-original-eagles
 -tribute-november-8-2026/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
