DESCRIPTION:Step inside the pages of a songwriter’s journal and meet **
 Audrey Rose**\, an 18-year-old singer-songwriter blending poetic storytell
 ing with a cinematic pop sound. On November 15\, to celebrate her golden e
 ighteenth birthday (Oct 18th)\, Audrey takes the Buskirk-Chumley stage for
  her first ticketed hometown concert\, sharing full-band originals and rei
 magined covers\, intimate acoustic moments\, and the stories behind the so
 ngs. Come for the music\, step into her world\, and maybe find a little pi
 ece of yourself there\, too.
